Z||000000||superXmotorsports||10-19-1999||09:01 PM||||Does anybody know of lower gears I can put into my 87 GT that I'm redoing.  I only read once in a Kitcar mag that a guy with an Artero car was running 3.73's.  I'm building another 3.2L and would love lower gears.<BR>Thanks!||||reg||5
